2.
Definitions
.-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Press Council Act, 1978 (
37 of 1978
);
(b)
"Secretary" means the Secretary of the Council appointed under section 11;
(c)
"section" means a section of the Act;
(d)
words and expressions used but not defined herein shall have the meanings assigned to them in the Act.
